<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following</p>
<p>Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		40/30 D	June	    40/30 D</p>
<p> July		35/30 D	July	    35/30 D</p>
<p> August	    10/15 P	August	  10/15 P</p>
<p> Sept	     95/110 P	Sept	   95/110 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		31/30 D	June	    32/30 D</p>
<p> July		13/12 D	July	    31/30 D</p>
<p> August		5/7 P	August	 11/8.5 D</p>
<p> Sept		19/25 P	Sept	    6/7.5 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		20/35 P	 June	  even/4 P</p>
<p> July	    even/40 P	 July	   10/20 P</p>
<p> August	  even/30 P	 August     even/30 P</p>
<p> Sept	    even/30 P	 Sept	   10/40 P</p>
